 dangerous buildings, solve puzzles and manage limited supplies, with each character following a storyline of their own.\n\nTension comes from cautious exploration and close encounters rather than constant firefights. It is a single-player game with full controller support, suited to horror fans who like atmospheric, deliberate pacing, as well as newcomers who want an entry point into the Raccoon City story."}}